// input: after idr-simplify
// FILECHECK-OPTIONS: --implicit-check-not={{[^#]}}idr.closure --implicit-check-not=idr.apply --implicit-check-not=arith.muli
// rule: ELIM-G-1, ELIM-G-7, TEST-ELIM-1
// No closure is left after the simplify loop: the lambda applied to 7 is
