// checked TT), and so are the IO actions' closures of putStrLn, applied
// where they are built (idr.apply of a known idr.closure is a call, then
// inlined). The line is one constant, written by one put_str.
// CHECK: idr.constant "21\0A"
// CHECK: idr.io.put_str
